    <p>LG Energy Solution has announced <a href="https://news.lgensol.com/company-news/press-releases/5575/?hl=en-GB">Re.Pulse</a>, a battery-diagnostic technology it says measures cell condition using electrical pulses. We do not know whether it will form part of H572 or apply to I-PACE batteries. It is worth watching, not evidence of a remedy.</p>
